t   in-memory map holds is observable through the handle; what the file\n   435\t   holds is observable here.\"\n   436\t  [path]\n   437\t  (let [f (open-file! path)]\n   438\t    (try (mapv (fn [[address payload]]\n   439\t                 [address (jing/segment-value address payload)])\n   440\t               (recover! f))\n   441\t         (finally (close-file! f)))))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
